    <dc:title>Coupled Dynamic Simulator With Tri-Dexel Milling Module For Robotic Machining Operations</dc:title>
    <z:abstractNote>A coupled robotic machining simulator links machine dynamics with dexel-based material removal, cutting-force computation and updated workpiece geometry. Experimental milling tests verify forces, deviations and geometry.</z:abstractNote>
