    <z:itemType>report</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>Finite Element Simulation of macroscopic Machining Processes - Implementation of time dependent Domain and Boundary Conditions</dc:title>
    <z:abstractNote>A dexel-based material-removal simulation is coupled to thermomechanical finite elements and process models for cutting forces and heat flux, to predict macroscopic shape errors on a time-dependent domain. Microscopic chip formation is represented through process models rather than explicitly resolved.</z:abstractNote>
